# SportSpot – Complete Turf Booking SaaS

SportSpot should be designed as a complete turf booking and management platform, not just a website where customers submit booking requests.

The main idea is that customers can check available slots, book and pay online, receive confirmation, and manage their bookings. At the same time, the turf owner can manage online bookings, walk-in customers, payments, pricing, schedules, and business performance through a separate admin dashboard.

The most important feature: online and walk-in bookings must use the same live availability system. When someone books a slot at the turf counter, that slot should immediately become unavailable online. The same should happen when a customer books online. This prevents double bookings.

